<h1>Swing level revisits</h1><p>Which candle level reacts when price returns—and does that reaction happen before the original swing boundaries break?</p><p id="lrCoverage">Loading audit…</p>
<section><form id="lrFilters">
<label>Swing name<select id="scenario"><option value="*">All observed names</option></select></label>
